WEBVTT

00:00:09.615 --> 00:00:14.245
Hatenkou Yugi

00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:18.556
The departure always comes unexpectedly

00:00:18.557 --> 00:00:22.027
It is destined to happen like a coincidence

00:00:22.027 --> 00:00:27.829
Your evolving fate starts to grind

00:00:28.901 --> 00:00:32.268
Confused by sudden rain

00:00:32.437 --> 00:00:35.706
Stunned by getting rejected and soaked in the rain

00:00:35.707 --> 00:00:41.805
Let’s laugh it off: a new path will open for you

00:00:42.447 --> 00:00:45.616
What’s the most precious thing

00:00:45.617 --> 00:00:49.187
That’s hidden behind meaningless things

00:00:49.187 --> 00:00:57.094
You can make miracles happen, so keep smiling

00:00:57.763 --> 00:01:00.596
My Heartbreaking Romance

00:01:00.799 --> 00:01:04.836
Let’s go wild as you desire

00:01:04.836 --> 00:01:10.138
Have a blast and live it up: that’s my style

00:01:11.043 --> 00:01:14.171
Your Heartrending Sorrow

00:01:14.479 --> 00:01:18.416
| will leave it alone for now

00:01:18.417 --> 00:01:24.879
So let’s begin our adventure right here

00:01:25.157 --> 00:01:29.992
Am | ever

00:01:46.912 --> 00:01:50.439
So, which did you bet on?
The sergeant or the newbie?

00:01:50.582 --> 00:01:52.345
| haven't bet on either.

00:01:52.684 --> 00:01:53.844
You aren’t betting?

00:01:53.986 --> 00:01:55.687
| have no cash on me.

00:01:55.687 --> 00:01:57.121
Wanna borrow some?

00:01:57.122 --> 00:02:02.253
No. Just thinking about the interest
you’d charge scares the hell out of me.

00:02:04.129 --> 00:02:07.155
Wait, | did have something else to bet with.

00:02:14.873 --> 00:02:18.274
Is that all you got?
You might want to throw in the towel.

00:02:19.811 --> 00:02:21.608
Hey, c’mon, Newbie!

00:02:21.913 --> 00:02:24.939
This guy right here is betting his life on you!

00:02:46.004 --> 00:02:52.273
It feels like such a long time ago...
a time of adolescence that everyone experiences.

00:02:53.145 --> 00:02:55.238
My heartache touches my entire body.

00:02:55.614 --> 00:02:58.549
That’s someone | will never forget...

00:03:00.218 --> 00:03:01.276
Alzeid.

00:03:03.855 --> 00:03:08.087
Unknown
Pestination (First Part)

00:03:08.293 --> 00:03:09.089
You heard me?

00:03:09.428 --> 00:03:11.020
I’m not gonna look for you even if you get lost.

00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:12.353
Make sure not to get separated.

00:03:12.497 --> 00:03:13.464
Roger that!

00:03:13.632 --> 00:03:15.266
Hey, they’re selling roasted chestnuts.

00:03:15.267 --> 00:03:16.063
Hold it.

00:03:16.334 --> 00:03:18.102
What? Look, it’s over there.

00:03:18.103 --> 00:03:19.695
Were you even listening to what | said?

00:03:19.871 --> 00:03:21.072
It’s roasted chestnuts I’m talking about.

00:03:21.073 --> 00:03:22.040
They’re yummy.

00:03:22.040 --> 00:03:23.735
We should satisfy our appetite.

00:03:24.309 --> 00:03:25.105
Listen...

00:03:25.477 --> 00:03:27.775
do you understand what we have to do right now?

00:03:28.046 --> 00:03:33.074
Um... finding Heat-tan, who arrived here
before us, so we can join him?

00:03:33.351 --> 00:03:35.012
How come you talk like you doubt yourself?

00:03:35.487 --> 00:03:37.955
Just behave yourself for crying out loud.

00:03:38.957 --> 00:03:43.360
I’m tired of getting caught up
in the troubles you constantly bring.

00:03:46.998 --> 00:03:48.199
You know what | mean?

00:03:48.200 --> 00:03:49.768
I’m taking this as compensation.

00:03:49.768 --> 00:03:51.201
Cut it out! Let me go!

00:03:51.403 --> 00:03:54.506
Instead of money,
we'll get you off the hook with this!

00:03:54.506 --> 00:03:56.064
Stop! Stop it!

00:03:56.775 --> 00:03:57.935
Listen, Rahzel.

00:03:58.310 --> 00:04:01.211
Try to learn lessons from your own actions.

00:04:01.713 --> 00:04:03.977
In the first place, you tend to get carried away—

00:04:04.382 --> 00:04:05.406
Are you listening?

00:04:10.856 --> 00:04:12.791
I’m taking this.

00:04:12.791 --> 00:04:13.883
Give it back!

00:04:14.626 --> 00:04:15.326
Give it back!

00:04:15.327 --> 00:04:16.259
GIVE IT BACK!

00:04:16.595 --> 00:04:18.825
Here, come and get it.

00:04:19.197 --> 00:04:20.459
Oops-a-daisy!

00:04:24.636 --> 00:04:26.433
Here, I’m giving this back to you.

00:04:27.005 --> 00:04:30.805
Just don’t tell anyone that | shouted
“Oops-a-daisy” like an old woman.

00:04:31.009 --> 00:04:32.670
O-okay.

00:04:32.911 --> 00:04:34.312
What’s the big idea?

00:04:34.312 --> 00:04:35.939
Don’t get cute with us!

00:04:36.581 --> 00:04:39.345
Don’t get so peeved
just because | used you as a footrest.

00:04:39.584 --> 00:04:41.347
Are you getting enough calcium?

00:04:41.653 --> 00:04:42.779
Stop messing with us.

00:04:42.954 --> 00:04:44.979
We're gonna strip you down
and make you pay us back!

00:04:47.859 --> 00:04:49.794
Wh-what the hell?

00:04:49.795 --> 00:04:51.396
What’s going on?

00:04:51.396 --> 00:04:52.454
It’s all squishy!

00:04:52.931 --> 00:04:55.422
Isn’t a fight something you do
with your bare hands?

00:04:55.700 --> 00:04:58.032
Rule breakers will be ejected.

00:05:11.283 --> 00:05:13.184
So, that was magic, right?

00:05:13.185 --> 00:05:15.620
So cool! I’ve never seen it before.

00:05:15.620 --> 00:05:18.646
If you like it, | can show you
as much as you want.

00:05:19.157 --> 00:05:20.556
Look, here’s a water trick.

00:05:24.262 --> 00:05:26.355
Go round and round and round...

00:05:27.098 --> 00:05:28.799
Okay, applause!

00:05:28.800 --> 00:05:30.597
Amazing!

00:05:31.503 --> 00:05:33.835
So... Vincent, was it?

00:05:34.139 --> 00:05:35.299
Just call me Vi.

00:05:35.907 --> 00:05:37.272
Where are your parents?

00:05:37.576 --> 00:05:38.804
Or are you lost?

00:05:39.211 --> 00:05:44.239
No. I’m on the way to Obplay
with some men | know.

00:05:44.382 --> 00:05:45.716
You're traveling?

00:05:45.717 --> 00:05:46.851
So aml.

00:05:46.852 --> 00:05:49.184
But you should be more careful,
or those bad guys will...

00:05:51.857 --> 00:05:53.984
That’s something important to you, isn’t it?

00:05:54.926 --> 00:05:59.693
Yeah. Without this,
nobody would know who | am.

00:06:00.799 --> 00:06:01.493
Is that right?

00:06:01.900 --> 00:06:05.700
As long as you know who you are,
that’s all that matters.

00:06:10.108 --> 00:06:11.370
I’ve been looking for you, Vi.

00:06:12.944 --> 00:06:14.070
Good grief.

00:06:14.412 --> 00:06:17.711
| need you to stop bringing me
any more troubles.

00:06:18.316 --> 00:06:18.983
Ow!

00:06:18.984 --> 00:06:20.118
Cut it out!

00:06:20.118 --> 00:06:20.948
And you are?

00:06:21.620 --> 00:06:23.781
This lady saved me earlier... Ow!

00:06:24.189 --> 00:06:25.986
| see. Well, | appreciate that.

00:06:26.758 --> 00:06:29.921
Although, an outsider shouldn't
stick their nose into our business.

00:06:30.262 --> 00:06:31.024
I see.

00:06:31.263 --> 00:06:33.424
Then, I'll just have to use my leg, not my nose!

00:06:37.969 --> 00:06:39.197
Y-you little...

00:06:39.871 --> 00:06:43.705
It’s the guardian’s sheer negligence
that's to blame when kids get lost.

00:06:43.808 --> 00:06:45.241
Fair enough.

00:06:45.510 --> 00:06:51.813
But I’m not so tolerant that I'll endure
this humiliation and have a nice talk with you.

00:06:53.118 --> 00:06:55.518
Huh? Wh-what’s going on?

00:06:56.855 --> 00:07:03.124
Now, let me slice
that pretty face of yours into pieces.

00:07:03.461 --> 00:07:05.362
Pretty face? I’m flattered.

00:07:05.363 --> 00:07:06.523
You look good yourself.

00:07:06.798 --> 00:07:09.392
You are just not my type, though.

00:07:11.436 --> 00:07:13.233
Hold it right there!

00:07:14.706 --> 00:07:16.173
Ha, ha, ha!

00:07:17.842 --> 00:07:21.938
All of you good kids!
Violence will get you nowhere!

00:07:22.681 --> 00:07:23.648
Heat-tan?

00:07:24.749 --> 00:07:26.182
Wh-who, me?

00:07:26.518 --> 00:07:29.954
I’m just an afro gentleman passing by.

00:07:31.356 --> 00:07:32.457
Heat-tan!

00:07:32.457 --> 00:07:36.052
Huh? How did you know it was me, Rahzel-chan?

00:07:36.661 --> 00:07:37.355
Rahzel?

00:07:37.562 --> 00:07:40.298
| already knew this,
but you're a total idiot, huh?

00:07:40.298 --> 00:07:42.095
Damn, | had confidence in my disguise.

00:07:42.600 --> 00:07:43.191
Rahzel?

00:07:45.236 --> 00:07:47.568
Yes, this is my sweetheart, Rahzel-chan.

00:07:47.806 --> 00:07:50.741
Then... Then, he’s with you, too?

00:07:51.543 --> 00:07:52.237
Huh?

00:08:01.920 --> 00:08:05.056
Well, well, you’re as alert as ever.

00:08:05.056 --> 00:08:05.988
Soresta.

00:08:08.626 --> 00:08:10.457
It’s been a while, Alzeid.

00:08:28.847 --> 00:08:31.247
I see. So that’s the kid.

00:08:31.483 --> 00:08:34.452
Yeah. He’s from quite a wealthy family.

00:08:34.986 --> 00:08:37.352
They’re in the middle of family troubles right now.

00:08:37.589 --> 00:08:42.583
So there must be a reason
for a military unit like yours to protect him.

00:08:43.261 --> 00:08:45.456
Hey, what do you mean by military unit?

00:08:45.897 --> 00:08:49.424
Well, the three of us used to be
in the same unit.

00:08:50.235 --> 00:08:52.499
Those were the good old days.

00:08:52.804 --> 00:08:54.362
You remember, right?

00:08:54.672 --> 00:08:56.902
The first mission we formed a task force for?

00:08:57.108 --> 00:08:59.133
You mean the one where we blew up the castle?

00:08:59.277 --> 00:09:00.039
A castle?

00:09:06.351 --> 00:09:10.981
It was a crisis situation where a member
of the royal family had been taken hostage.

00:09:11.656 --> 00:09:15.854
The rescue was successful, but shaking off
the pursuers was too much of a hassle.

00:09:24.202 --> 00:09:25.760
Talk about negligent.

00:09:26.104 --> 00:09:27.738
We avoided the extra hassle, that’s all.

00:09:27.739 --> 00:09:30.333
Oh yeah, | want to
show you something, Rahzel-chan.

00:09:30.742 --> 00:09:31.868
Huh? What is it?

00:09:33.445 --> 00:09:35.208
Wow, so cute!

00:09:35.513 --> 00:09:37.276
Is this from when he was in the military?

00:09:38.483 --> 00:09:40.041
And the next is—

00:09:41.553 --> 00:09:43.783
Wha... Wha... Wha... Wha... Wha...

00:09:44.055 --> 00:09:45.818
What on Earth is this?

00:09:46.558 --> 00:09:49.322
He was known for his attitude back then, too.

00:09:49.828 --> 00:09:51.693
So we dragged him into a poker game;

00:09:51.930 --> 00:09:55.500
whoever lost had to serve the winner
dressed up as a woman.

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.298
And Alzeid lost big time.

00:09:59.104 --> 00:10:01.629
As a matter of fact, | cheated.

00:10:04.075 --> 00:10:06.305
I’m going to use your cigarette butt
for your grave marker, do you mind?

00:10:06.711 --> 00:10:10.306
Anyway, those were really great times.

00:10:10.548 --> 00:10:11.640
That so?

00:10:12.217 --> 00:10:13.309
Yeah.

00:10:13.751 --> 00:10:14.775
Now, now...

00:10:17.555 --> 00:10:20.190
By the way, that afro...

00:10:20.191 --> 00:10:21.215
why do you have it?

00:10:21.493 --> 00:10:23.120
Oh, this? Well...

00:10:23.928 --> 00:10:27.694
If possible, | was hoping
not to see you today, Rahzel-chan.

00:10:28.833 --> 00:10:29.595
Why?

00:10:30.535 --> 00:10:34.403
Because | didn’t want to have to say goodbye.

00:10:53.324 --> 00:10:54.723
What’s the big idea?!

00:10:56.794 --> 00:10:57.761
I’m sorry.

00:11:14.245 --> 00:11:16.440
What was that about?

00:11:18.316 --> 00:11:19.943
Wake up, Idiot.

00:11:20.585 --> 00:11:21.786
Wh-what the heck?

00:11:21.786 --> 00:11:23.686
Barging into a girl’s room without knocking!

00:11:24.756 --> 00:11:27.486
Besides, | was already awake.

00:11:30.028 --> 00:11:30.756
Rahzel...

00:11:30.929 --> 00:11:31.793
What?

00:11:32.497 --> 00:11:34.932
...don’t use your magic for a while.

00:11:34.933 --> 00:11:35.661
Huh?

00:11:40.104 --> 00:11:42.436
Explain why, or | won’t be convinced!

00:11:43.074 --> 00:11:46.566
You got into a fight
with Soresta yesterday, didn’t you?

00:11:49.380 --> 00:11:53.146
Oh, that? If Heat-tan hadn't gotten in the way, I’d—

00:11:53.418 --> 00:11:55.283
You would have been defeated.

00:11:56.588 --> 00:11:59.421
Didn’t he lift you into the air?

00:11:59.891 --> 00:12:00.949
Y-yeah.

00:12:02.460 --> 00:12:04.394
That’s the trick he uses.

00:12:19.911 --> 00:12:23.347
N-now that | know his trick,
| won’t fall for it again!

00:12:23.815 --> 00:12:24.713
Oh?

00:12:49.974 --> 00:12:52.340
Even if you’re this vulnerable?

00:12:52.644 --> 00:12:54.874
Are you sexually harassing me?
ll kick you where it counts.

00:12:55.146 --> 00:12:56.080
Don’t be silly.

00:12:56.080 --> 00:12:57.314
Anyway, you aren’t allowed to use magic.

00:12:57.315 --> 00:12:58.646
You have no objection, right?

00:12:58.916 --> 00:13:00.508
Yeah, | do have an objection!

00:13:00.785 --> 00:13:01.774
The time limit is...

00:13:02.754 --> 00:13:04.522
let’s see... three days would be enough.

00:13:04.522 --> 00:13:06.251
That shouldn't be so bad, right?

00:13:06.691 --> 00:13:09.990
If you use magic during that time,
ll terminate our partnership.

00:13:10.261 --> 00:13:12.627
What do you mean? How come it’s so one-sided?

00:13:13.865 --> 00:13:16.231
You can’t do anything without magic, huh?

00:13:17.101 --> 00:13:17.829
What?

00:13:18.870 --> 00:13:19.802
Three days?

00:13:20.071 --> 00:13:22.437
Don’t give me that half-hearted nonsense.

00:13:22.707 --> 00:13:24.299
Let’s make it one week.

00:13:24.509 --> 00:13:25.710
Not a big deal.

00:13:25.710 --> 00:13:27.940
lll complete the challenge perfectly.

00:13:31.916 --> 00:13:36.353
That cute maid, Alzeid, is such a bully!

00:13:38.356 --> 00:13:39.345
Good grief.

00:13:42.193 --> 00:13:45.720
So... How long are you gonna hide there?

00:13:47.065 --> 00:13:50.228
You owe me an explanation.
About yesterday as well.

00:13:55.173 --> 00:13:56.037
Come in.

00:13:57.542 --> 00:13:58.509
Is Vi here?

00:13:58.509 --> 00:13:59.874
Rahzel? Rahzel!

00:14:01.579 --> 00:14:02.413
Rahzel!

00:14:02.413 --> 00:14:03.846
Good morning, Vi.

00:14:04.315 --> 00:14:05.407
What do you want?

00:14:05.783 --> 00:14:09.048
Did you want to hear more about
my amusing episodes with Alzeid?

00:14:09.654 --> 00:14:12.953
How about the horrific athletic event
with a bunch of bulls?

00:14:13.491 --> 00:14:14.617
No thanks.

00:14:14.792 --> 00:14:17.989
Anyway, mind if Vi goes out with me?

00:14:18.229 --> 00:14:20.561
Sure, | feel he's safe as long as
he’s under your protection.

00:14:20.698 --> 00:14:21.532
Let’s go then.

00:14:21.532 --> 00:14:22.199
Okay.

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.768
By the way, where’s Alzeid?

00:14:23.768 --> 00:14:26.134
| guess he’s still in my room.

00:14:28.606 --> 00:14:30.540
“My room,” huh?

00:14:32.810 --> 00:14:37.304
Huh? So | can’t see your magic anymore?
What a bummer.

00:14:37.982 --> 00:14:40.217
Well, we only need to be patient for a week.

00:14:40.218 --> 00:14:42.787
Then, will you teach me how to fight?

00:14:42.787 --> 00:14:44.188
| want to be a better fighter.

00:14:44.188 --> 00:14:47.157
That’s fine, but wouldn’t you
be embarrassed if a girl taught you?

00:14:47.558 --> 00:14:48.388
Right...

00:14:48.559 --> 00:14:50.527
How about you ask that guard of yours?

00:14:51.396 --> 00:14:52.727
| guess.

00:14:53.498 --> 00:14:56.834
If | ask, | don’t think he’d mind
teaching me things, but...

00:14:56.834 --> 00:15:00.361
Soresta seems kind of scary.

00:15:02.273 --> 00:15:03.467
I know.

00:15:03.975 --> 00:15:06.842
| can’t really tell what he’s thinking.

00:15:08.045 --> 00:15:09.342
Heat-tan, either.

00:15:11.282 --> 00:15:13.150
So that’s that.

00:15:13.151 --> 00:15:17.520
Soresta asked me to also guard that Vi kid.

00:15:17.755 --> 00:15:20.622
That’s why | had to say goodbye to Rahzel-chan.

00:15:22.126 --> 00:15:23.218
I see.

00:15:23.661 --> 00:15:27.290
It doesn't bother me. I'd be glad
that you're going away.

00:15:27.532 --> 00:15:32.032
The thing is, Soresta really wants you
to leave Rahzel and join us.

00:15:34.272 --> 00:15:35.273
What do you think?

00:15:35.273 --> 00:15:35.906
That’d be a pain.

00:15:35.907 --> 00:15:36.566
That figures.

00:15:37.175 --> 00:15:40.508
Besides, do you think | could leave
that careless woman alone?

00:15:40.845 --> 00:15:43.939
Unlike you, she considers me
her comrade, apparently.

00:15:44.182 --> 00:15:45.171
"Comrade"?

00:15:45.817 --> 00:15:48.019
So you say, but you aren’t treating her nicely.

00:15:48.019 --> 00:15:49.543
Like forbidding her to use magic.

00:15:49.887 --> 00:15:52.947
I’m simply giving her
the opportunity to reflect on herself.

00:15:53.958 --> 00:15:57.826
She has the tendency
to overestimate her own abilities.

00:15:58.930 --> 00:16:02.593
Even more so since she has magic up her sleeve.

00:16:04.001 --> 00:16:05.093
That’s all?

00:16:06.237 --> 00:16:07.499
What’s your point?

00:16:07.872 --> 00:16:08.964
Never mind.

00:16:09.407 --> 00:16:11.841
Well, good luck with that, Young Man.

00:16:12.477 --> 00:16:15.241
The characters for “prime of youth”
represent "blue spring."

00:16:16.314 --> 00:16:18.077
Is your brain functioning?

00:16:18.416 --> 00:16:20.518
The prime of youth, my ass!

00:16:20.518 --> 00:16:21.951
You're an idiot.

00:16:24.822 --> 00:16:27.916
Now, | guess I’ll have you make a move.

00:16:32.363 --> 00:16:34.354
| need you to come with us.

00:16:39.103 --> 00:16:42.971
What’s your intention in bringing us
to this deserted alley?

00:16:43.508 --> 00:16:47.945
It’s getting dark soon.
We should be heading back to the inn.

00:16:47.945 --> 00:16:49.207
Keep quiet!

00:16:50.414 --> 00:16:51.448
What are you doing?

00:16:51.449 --> 00:16:52.516
Rahzel!

00:16:52.517 --> 00:16:53.351
Get up!

00:16:53.351 --> 00:16:54.750
Hold on, it’s my shoelace...

00:16:55.152 --> 00:16:56.244
As if.

00:16:59.991 --> 00:17:02.391
Actually, | don’t have shoelaces.

00:17:05.563 --> 00:17:06.864
Oops-a-daisy!

00:17:06.864 --> 00:17:09.059
Uh-oh, | just said it again.

00:17:09.367 --> 00:17:11.528
Dammit, you impertinent broad!

00:17:13.738 --> 00:17:14.572
Run!

00:17:14.572 --> 00:17:15.402
Okay!

00:17:16.908 --> 00:17:18.205
Who are those guys?

00:17:18.476 --> 00:17:22.003
| doubt the punks from yesterday
returned for payback.

00:17:25.349 --> 00:17:29.012
Well, let’s put that aside for now.
We just need to—

00:17:31.489 --> 00:17:32.854
Nowhere to run?

00:17:36.594 --> 00:17:37.993
That’s not necessarily the case.

00:17:41.966 --> 00:17:43.263
Vi, follow me.

00:17:45.036 --> 00:17:46.765
This must be a grocery warehouse.

00:17:47.038 --> 00:17:48.972
It doesn’t look like anyone is here.

00:17:49.440 --> 00:17:50.964
Let’s see...

00:17:51.676 --> 00:17:53.940
Good, that will do!

00:17:55.212 --> 00:17:56.270
Rahzel?

00:17:57.982 --> 00:18:00.007
Hey, they have some nice wines.

00:18:00.217 --> 00:18:03.420
What are you doing? Let’s get out
through the front door right now.

00:18:03.421 --> 00:18:05.651
The enemy are four armed men.

00:18:06.090 --> 00:18:08.456
| can tell that they’ve received
decent combat training.

00:18:08.893 --> 00:18:11.521
So we have no chance of winning
if we make a frontal attack.

00:18:11.862 --> 00:18:13.363
Exactly. We need to run now!

00:18:13.364 --> 00:18:14.228
Hey, Vi...

00:18:15.333 --> 00:18:16.823
do you trust me?

00:18:19.270 --> 00:18:20.032
Yeah.

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:23.168
Okay.

00:18:23.808 --> 00:18:26.677
Then, look for flour, sugar, or cocoa on that shelf.

00:18:26.677 --> 00:18:28.736
Just gather whatever powder you can find.

00:18:29.046 --> 00:18:30.240
Ill take care of this side.

00:18:31.115 --> 00:18:31.809
Got it.

00:18:34.352 --> 00:18:36.013
What are you gonna do with these anyway?

00:18:37.054 --> 00:18:40.023
It’s a contemporary,
engineering science, hands-on lesson!

00:18:43.427 --> 00:18:44.257
lt’s a dead end.

00:18:44.662 --> 00:18:46.289
This is the only way they could have gone.

00:18:52.703 --> 00:18:54.638
How come it’s so dusty in here?

00:18:54.639 --> 00:18:56.674
It’s so dark, | can’t even see anything.

00:18:56.674 --> 00:18:59.243
Anyone got a light?

00:18:59.243 --> 00:19:00.005
Hold on.

00:19:13.190 --> 00:19:14.122
Is that...?

00:19:15.926 --> 00:19:20.522
Alzeid, wanna join me for dinner
and watch the campfire?

00:19:20.831 --> 00:19:22.032
What a nosy bastard.

00:19:22.033 --> 00:19:23.467
You've got tacky taste.

00:19:23.467 --> 00:19:26.265
Well, | just thought we might as well.

00:19:27.204 --> 00:19:28.831
What do you mean by “might as well’?

00:19:29.273 --> 00:19:32.504
That girl, Rahzel, isn’t allowed
to use magic, right?

00:19:32.910 --> 00:19:38.075
Since our Vi is with her right now,
| need to make certain that they’re both safe.

00:19:41.252 --> 00:19:43.720
Hey, what just happened?

00:19:44.388 --> 00:19:46.289
Have you ever heard of a dust explosion?

00:19:46.290 --> 00:19:47.416
What is that?

00:19:48.626 --> 00:19:55.225
When any dispersed powdered combustible
particles are present in the atmosphere,

00:19:55.599 --> 00:19:58.301
they cause a large chain reaction when ignited.

00:19:58.302 --> 00:20:00.463
In other words, they explode.

00:20:02.106 --> 00:20:05.507
| understand the logic,
but the trap door won’t open.

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.510
Maybe something’s stuck above it.

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.550
If there’s a fire up there, we'll be roasted.

00:20:12.550 --> 00:20:14.040
Rahzel!

00:20:15.920 --> 00:20:18.912
Oh, maybe you can use magic
in a situation like this.

00:20:19.323 --> 00:20:22.486
So, why did you decide to trust me?

00:20:23.060 --> 00:20:24.652
Is it because | can use magic?

00:20:26.030 --> 00:20:28.260
No. It’s because we’re friends.

00:20:30.034 --> 00:20:31.797
Magic comes in handy, huh?

00:20:32.169 --> 00:20:34.865
I'd be lying if | said
that | don’t overly rely on it.

00:20:35.072 --> 00:20:39.907
Then again, | can still do anything
and go anywhere without it.

00:20:40.611 --> 00:20:41.373
Because...

00:20:52.523 --> 00:20:55.287
This is considered property damage, Idiot.

00:20:55.960 --> 00:21:02.957
Because | know that you always reach out
your hand to me with that curt look on your face.

00:21:05.603 --> 00:21:07.127
Will you pay for the damage for me?

00:21:08.973 --> 00:21:09.997
| couldn't care less.

00:21:11.075 --> 00:21:13.407
Rahzel-chan tries hard, huh?

00:21:14.245 --> 00:21:15.507
It’s not funny.

00:21:15.946 --> 00:21:19.677
The kid, Soresta, is already getting out of control.

00:21:20.017 --> 00:21:23.420
So you say, but you seem
to be enjoying yourself, Mr. Employer.

00:21:23.420 --> 00:21:26.719
Well, you can leave this case to me.

00:21:27.258 --> 00:21:29.317
You won’t regret it.

00:21:43.674 --> 00:21:47.344
As | hear the sound of laughter

00:21:47.344 --> 00:21:50.973
Coming from the room next door

00:21:51.148 --> 00:21:58.350
| slowly wake up to the morning that | adore

00:21:58.722 --> 00:22:05.958
Somewhere | dreamed of a painting

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:13.534
| just painted a new chair for you

00:22:13.704 --> 00:22:18.204
Even if the sorrowful story

00:22:20.644 --> 00:22:29.348
Is lying in wait beyond the curtain

00:22:31.355 --> 00:22:38.591
Even if we may feel like strangers tomorrow

00:22:38.863 --> 00:22:45.996
| believe in the perfect miracle that you'll still be here

00:22:46.303 --> 00:22:53.641
The hand you reached out shows no sign of parting

00:22:53.978 --> 00:23:01.714
As | grow teary-eyed, | just want to hold you now
